# PROJECT: NOVA AI
## Build an Advanced Voice-Controlled Personal AI Assistant — Web Edition

You are a senior AI engineer, full-stack developer, software architect, real-time audio engineer, security engineer, and premium UI/UX designer.

Your task is to build NOVA AI: a sophisticated, real-time, voice-controlled personal AI assistant that operates entirely through a modern web application.

This is not a traditional chatbot.

Build a functional AI companion capable of understanding natural speech, responding with natural speech, searching the internet, generating images, interacting with supported web services, analyzing documents, managing personal tasks, and executing authorized workflows.

The application must prioritize:

1. Real-time voice-to-voice interaction.
2. Natural wake-word activation.
3. Local-first privacy and memory.
4. Reliable AI tool execution.
5. Beautiful futuristic user experience.
6. Mobile and desktop browser compatibility.
7. Secure API and integration architecture.

Do not create a decorative prototype. Implement real functionality wherever the necessary APIs and permissions are available.

When an external service requires credentials, show its connection status and provide clear configuration instructions. Never simulate successful execution of an unavailable service.

